  "description": "Jae-Yoon Kang has finally decided to find a new place to live because he just can't keep up with the noise. But little did he know, it was quite challenging to find the perfect place in his budget. His last hope is Young-Han Seo, competent realtor with the looks. When Mr. perfect is helping for studio apartment hunt, Jae-Yoon realizes that he's more interested in him than the property hunting. Now, Jae-Yoon is ready to attract Young-Han's attention, by any means necessary.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: The chapter count includes 3 side stories.*",
